                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Twisted (and Twisted: Enhanced Edition) is an indie-made sci-fi puzzle and combat platformer, developed by “Games by Brundle”, currently on Early Access on Steam. The game currently features no backstory, however, the mechanics and puzzles were enough to keep me amused for a while.\n\nThe graphics are low-res, but pretty and charming. The music fits the scene well and helps to calm your nerves on the harder levels, and the enemies and obstacles vary enough to keep this game interesting until the end.\n\nTwisted is short and simple, but by no means easy. If you like a challenge, some physics-altering gadgets, or a charming platformer, this game is probably for you.\n\n",
